#: addcatdialog.cpp:84
msgid ""
"A valid custom catalog file has one line per object, with the following "
"fields in each line:"
msgstr ""
"En gellen egen Kataloog bargt een Reeg per Objekt mit de nakamen Feller in "
"elk Reeg:"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:86
msgid ""
"1. Type identifier.  Must be one of: 0 (star), 3 (open cluster), 4 (globular "
"cluster), 5 (gaseous nebula), 6 (planetary nebula), 7 (supernova remnant), "
"or 8 (galaxy)"
msgstr ""
"1. Typbeteker:  Mutt 0 (Steern), 3 (apen Hopen), 4 (Kugelhopen), 5 "
"(Gasnevel), 6 (Planetennevel), 7 (Supernova-Nablievels) oder 8 (Galaxie) "
"wesen"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:88
msgid "2. Right Ascension (floating-point value)"
msgstr "2. Rektaszenschoon (Fleetkommaweert)"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:89
msgid "3. Declination (floating-point value)"
msgstr "3. Deklinatschoon (Fleetkommaweert)"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:90
msgid "4. Magnitude (floating-point value)"
msgstr "4. Magnituud (Fleetkommaweert)"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:91
msgid "5. Spectral type (if type=0); otherwise object's catalog name"
msgstr "5. Spektraaltyp (wenn Typ=0); anners de Kataloognaam vun't Objekt"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:92
msgid ""
"6. Star name (if type=0); otherwise object's common name. [field 6 is "
"optional]"
msgstr ""
"6. Steernnaam (wenn Typ=0); anners de allgemeen Naam vun't Objekt. [Feld 6 "
"is optschonaal]"

#. +> trunk
#: addcatdialog.cpp:94
msgid ""
"The fields should be separated by whitespace.  In addition, the catalog may "
"contain comment lines beginning with '#'."
msgstr ""
"De Feller schöölt mit Freetekens trennt wesen. De Kataloog dörv ok "
"Kommentarregen bargen, de mit \"#\" anfangt."

