#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 175
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2526 rc.cpp:4186
msgid ""
"Welcome to the <b>KStars Telescope Setup Wizard!</b>\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"This Wizard will help you to connect to your telescope and control it from "
"KStars. You will be asked to verify some basic information.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>You can get extended information on telescope support in KStars by "
"pressing the <tt>help</tt> button at any point during the Wizard.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Please click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Willkamen bi den <b>Teleskoop-Inrichthölper vun KStars!</b>\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Disse Hölper ünnerstütt Di bi't Tokoppeln na Dien Teleskoop un bi't Stüern "
"vun dat Deert mit KStars. Du muttst en poor Grundinformatschonen pröven.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>Mehr Informatschonen över de Teleskoop-Ünnerstütten vun KStars laat sik "
"jümmers mit en Klick op den <tt>Hülp</tt>-Knoop halen, wielt de Hölper "
"löppt.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Bitte klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du wiedermaken wullt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 212
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2535 rc.cpp:4195
msgid ""
"<h3>1. Telescope Model</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Please select your telescope model from the list below. Click next after "
"selecting a model."
msgstr ""
"<h3>1. Teleskoop-Modell</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Bitte söök nerrn Dien Teleskoop ut. Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du en Modell "
"utsöcht hest."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 296
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2540 rc.cpp:4200
msgid ""
"<b>Tip</b>\n"
"<br>Some non-Meade telescopes support a subset of the LX200 command set. "
"Select <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> to control such devices."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tipp</b>\n"
"<br>En Reeg vun Teleskopen, de nich vun \"Meade\" sünd, ünnerstütt liekers "
"de LX200-Befehlen deelwies. Söök <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> ut, wenn Du so en "
"Reedschap stüern wullt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 339
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2544 rc.cpp:4204
msgid ""
"<h3>2. Align Your Telescope</h3>\n"
"\n"
"You need to align your telescope before you can control it properly from "
"KStars. Please refer to your telescope manual for alignment instructions.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"After a successful alignment, connect your telescope's RS232 interface to "
"your computer's serial or USB port.\n"
"<br><br><br>Click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"<h3>2. Dien Teleskoop utrichten</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Ehr Du Dien Teleskoop richtig mit KStars stüern kannst, muttst Du dat "
"utrichten. Bitte kiek, wat dor Dien Teleskoop-Handbook över seggt.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Wenn Dien Teleskoop utricht is, koppel de RS-232-Koppelsteed vun Dien "
"Teleskoop na de serielle oder USB-Koppelsteed vun Dien Reekner to.\n"
"<br><br><br>Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du wiedermaken wullt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 374
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2552 rc.cpp:4212
msgid ""
"<h3>3. Verify Local Settings</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Verify if the following time, date, and location settings are correct. If "
"any of the settings are incorrect, you can correct them via the <tt>Set "
"time</tt> and <tt>Set Location</tt> buttons.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h3>3. Lokale Instellen överpröven</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Överprööv, wat de nakamen Angaven för Tiet, Datum un Standoort passt. Wenn "
"een dorvun falsch is, kannst Du ehr över de Knööp <tt>Tiet instellen</tt> "
"oder <tt>Oort instellen</tt> ännern.\n"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 458
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2558 rc.cpp:4218
msgid "<b>Location</b>"
msgstr "<b>Standoort</b>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 501
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2561 rc.cpp:4221
msgid "<b>Time</b>"
msgstr "<b>Tiet</b>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 508
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2564 rc.cpp:4224
msgid "<b>Date</b>"
msgstr "<b>Datum</b>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 534
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2567 rc.cpp:4227
msgid "Set Time..."
msgstr "Tiet instellen..."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 541
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2570 rc.cpp:4230
msgid "Set Location..."
msgstr "Standoort instellen..."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file telescopewizard.ui line 596
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:2573 rc.cpp:4233
msgid ""
"<h3>4. Determine Connection Port</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Enter the port number your telescope is connected to. If you only have one "
"serial port in your computer, the port is usually <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt>\n"
"<br><br>If you are unsure about the port number, you can leave the field "
"empty and KStars will try to scan the ports for attached telescopes. Beware "
"that the autoscan process might take a few minutes to complete. "
msgstr ""
"<h3>4. Koppelsteed rutfinnen</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Giff de Nummer vun de Koppelsteed in, na de dat Teleskoop tokoppelt is. Wenn "
"Du bloots een seriell Koppelsteed an Dien Reekner hest, is disse Koppelsteed "
"normalerwies <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt>.\n"
"<br><br>Wenn Du de Koppelsteednummer nich seker weetst, laat dit Feld "
"leddig; KStars kiekt denn de Koppelsteden na tokoppelt Teleskopen dör. "
"Beacht, dat de Söök en poor Minuten duern kann. "

