#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/argsettrack.ui line 38
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:4579
msgid ""
"If checked, the sky will remain focused on its current position or object as "
"time passes.  This is called \"Tracking\".  Note that tracking is "
"automatically engaged whenever an object is centered at the focus point.  "
"So, if you use \"lookToward\" with an object name, you do not need to engage "
"tracking.  \n"
"\n"
"If unchecked, then Tracking will be forced off, even if an object has been "
"centered,  As time passes, the sky will then appear to drift by (due to the "
"rotation of the Earth)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, blifft de Heven op de aktuelle Positschoon oder dat Objekt "
"utricht, bides de Tiet vörbigeiht. Dit warrt \"Mittrecken\" nöömt. Beacht, "
"dat Mittrecken warrt automaatsch anmaakt, wenn Du de Kiekricht op en Objekt "
"utrichtst. Wenn Du also \"lookToward\" (kieken na) mit en Objektnaam "
"bruukst, denn is ok \"Mittrecken\" automaatsch anmaakt.  \n"
"\n"
"Is dit utmaakt, blifft dat Mittrecken utmaakt, ok wenn Du en Objekt "
"inmiddelst. Wenn de Tiet vörbigeiht, denn lett dat, as wenn de Heven "
"vörbitreck (as Folg vun de Sülvstdreihen vun de Eer)."

