msgstr "All Sünnsysteem-Objekttypen op de List utsöken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 273
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6033
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Select by region</p><p></p><p>Next, you can "
"limit your object list to only those objects which occupy a specific region "
"on the sky.  There are three ways to specify the region for your list:  by "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">constellation</span>, by specifying a "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rectangular region</span>, or by "
"specifying a <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">circular region</span>.  You "
"may also skip selecting by a region, which will include objects from <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">all over the sky</span>.</p><p></p><p>Make your "
"selection below, and press <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span>.</"
"p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Na Rebeet utsöken</p><p></p><p>Nu kannst Du Dien "
"Objektenlist op de Objekten ingrenzen, de sik binnen en fastleggt "
"Hevenrebeet finnen laat.  Du kannst dat Rebeet op dree Oorden angeven: na "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Steernbild</span>, mit en <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">rechteckig Rebeet</span>, oder mit en <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Krinkrebeet</span>.  Du kannst de Köör na Rebeet ok utlaten, "
"denn warrt Objekten vun den  <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">helen Heven</"
"span> utsöcht.</p><p></p><p>Söök Dien Objekten nerrn ut, denn klick op <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 317
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6036
msgid "I wish to select objects:"
msgstr "Objektköör:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 349
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6039 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:168 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:358
msgid "all over the sky"
msgstr "Vun den helen Heven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 354
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6042 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:539
msgid "by constellation"
msgstr "Na Steernbild"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 359
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6045 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:164 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:547
msgid "in a rectangular region"
msgstr "Ut en Rechteck"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 364
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6048 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:166 tools/obslistwizard.cpp:565
msgid "in a circular region"
msgstr "Ut en Krink"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 406
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6051
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Select objects in one or more constellations</"
"p><p></p><p>In the list below, highlight the constellations you want to use "
"for your observing list.  Only objects that occupy the selected "
"constellations will be included in the list.</p><p></p><p>When you are "
"finished, press <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> to continue.</"
"p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Objekten in een oder mehr Steernbiller utsöken</"
"p><p></p><p>Söök op de List nerrn de Steernbiller ut, de Du för Dien Köör "
"bruken wullt.  Bloots Objekten ut de angeven Steernbiller warrt na de List "
"opnahmen.</p><p></p><p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</"
"span>, wenn du fardig büst un wiedermaken wullt.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 438
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6054
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Select objects in a rectangular region</p><p></"
"p><p>On this page, you can limit your observing list to those objects which "
"occupy a particular rectangular region on the sky.  Specify the rectangular "
"region by selecting the right ascension (RA) and declination (Dec) limits "
"that define the region.</p><p></p><p>When you are finished, press <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> to continue.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Objekten ut en Rechteckrebeet utsöken</p><p></"
"p><p>Op disse Siet kannst Du Dien Kieklist op Objekten ut en besünner "
"rechteckig Hevenrebeet ingrenzen. Dat Rebeet giffts Du mit de "
"Rektaszenschoon (Rek) un de Deklinatschoon (Dek) vun de Grenzen an.</p><p></"
"p><p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>, wenn Du "
"fardig büst un wiedermaken wullt.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 468
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 478
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6057 rc.cpp:6060
msgid "to"
msgstr "bet"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 491
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6063
msgid "Dec limits:"
msgstr "Dek-Grenzen:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 498
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6066
msgid "RA limits:"
msgstr "Rek-Grenzen:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 542
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6069
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Select objects in a circular region</p><p></"
"p><p>On this page, you can limit your observing list to those objects which "
"occupy a particular circular region on the sky.  Specify the circular region "
"by selecting the right ascension (RA) and declination (Dec) coordinates for "
"the center of the circle, and the size of the circle's radius, in Degrees.</"
"p><p></p><p>When you are finished, press <span style=\" font-weight:600;"
"\">Next</span> to continue.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Objekten ut en Krinkrebeet utsöken</p><p></"
"p><p>Op disse Siet kannst Du Dien Kieklist op Objekten ut en besünner Heven-"
"Krinkrebeet ingrenzen. Dat Rebeet giffst Du mit de Rektaszenschoon (Rek) un "
"de Deklinatschoon (Dek) vun den Krink sien Middelpunkt un sien Halfmaat in "
"Graad an.</p><p></p><p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</"
"span>, wenn Du fardig büst un wiedermaken wullt.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 619
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6072
msgid "center RA:"
msgstr "Rek vun de Merrn:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 632
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6075
msgid "center Dec:"
msgstr "Dek vun de Merrn:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 658
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6078
msgid "Radius (in Degrees):"
msgstr "Halfmaat (Graad):"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 704
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6081
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Select objects observable on a date:</p><p></"
"p><p>On this page, you can limit your observing list to only those objects "
"which can be observed on a particular date (and from a particular location "
"on Earth).  To filter your list in this way, check the checkbox below, and "
"then select the desired date.  If you leave this box unchecked, then your "
"list will include objects regardless of when they are observable (this is "
"the default).  You may also change the geographic location used to determine "
"whether objects are observable.</p><p></p><p>When you are finished, press "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> to continue.</p><p></p></"
"body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Op en Dag sichtbor Objekten utsöken:</p><p></"
"p><p>Op disse Siet kannst Du Dien Kieklist ehr Indrääg op Objekten "
"ingrenzen, de op en angeven Datum (un vun en fastleggt Steed op de Eer) "
"sichtbor sünd. Krüüz dat Krüüzfeld nerrn an un söök denn dat Datum ut, wenn "
"Du dat wullt. Lettst Du dat Krüüzfeld leddig, bargt Dien Kieklist all "
"Objekten, liek wannehr se sichtbor sünd (dat is de Vörinstellen). Du kannst "
"ok den Standoort ännern, he warrt för't Utreken vun de Objekten ehr "
"Sichtborkeit bruukt.</p><p></p><p>Büst Du fardig un wullt Du wiedermaken, "
"klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>.</p><p></p></"
"body></html>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 733
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6084
msgid "Select objects which are observable on:"
msgstr "Objekten utsöken, de sichtbor sünd op den:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 764
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6087
msgid "from: "
msgstr "vun dissen Standoort ut: "

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file tools/obslistwizard.ui line 838
#. +> trunk
#: rc.cpp:6093
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Select bright objects</p><p></p><p>On this page, "
"you can limit your observing list to only those objects brighter than a "
"given magnitude.  Be careful with this selection, because KStars does not "
"have a magnitude for every object in its database.  You need to indicate "
"whether you want to include objects with an undefined magnitude.</p><p></"
"p><p>If you do not wish to exclude faint objects with this selection, simply "
"leave the checkbox below unchecked.</p><p></p><p>This is the final page of "
"the Observing List Wizard.  You can go back and modify previous pages with "
"the <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Back</span> button.  When you are "
"satisfied, press the <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Finish</span> button "
"to exit the wizard, and the Observing List tool will be populated with the "
"objects you have specified here.</p><p></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body><p>Helle Objekten utsöken</p><p></p><p>Op dissen "
"Siet kannst Du de Objekten op Dien Kieklist op de ingrenzen, de heller sünd "
"as en angeven Magnituud. Wees mit disse Optschoon achtsom, KStars hett nich "
"för all Objekten en Magnituud binnen sien Datenbank. Du muttst angeven, wat "
"Du Objekten in- oder utsluten wullt, wenn dat dor keen Magnituud för gifft.</"
"p><p></p><p>Wullt Du keen düüster Objekten utsluten, laat dat Krüüzfeld "
"nerrn eenfach leddig.</p><p></p><p>Dit is de leste Siet vun den Kieklist-"
"Hölper. Mit den <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Torüch</span>-Knoop kannst "
"Du torüch gahn un de verleden Sieden ännern. Büst Du tofreden, klick op den "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Afsluten</span>-Knoop, denn warrt de "
"Hölper utmaakt un de Objekten, de Du hier utsöcht hest, de Kieklist toföögt."
